  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">DS Estudio Categorizacion - Reserva Ind&#xed;gena Napo, Tigre y Afluentes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The Development Services Agreement contemplates the elaboration of the Additional Categorization Study (EAC) of the Napo, Tigre and Tributaries Indigenous Reserve Request, which must contain an environmental, legal and anthropological analysis, as well as one (01) proposal for territorial delimitation. In addition, it includes the support for the government in preparing informative and socialization meetings with the communities close to the scope of the reference area of the SRINT, the holders of exploitation rights in the scope of the delimitation proposal, among others that the government requires.</narrative>
  </description>
